nd the GM received show-cause penalties over tampering.","published":"2026-11-24T20:05:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585093/ncaa-sanctions-liberty-transfer-portal-tampering","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star OT Lincoln Fa'alafi commits to Notre Dame, to join 2028 class","description":"New Zealand native Lincoln Fa'alafi, ESPN's No. 8 overall prospect in the 2028 cycle, committed Tuesday to Notre Dame.","published":"2026-11-24T19:56:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584881/notre-dame-gets-2028-commitment-ot-lincoln-faalafi","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"A timeline of Michigan athletics since 2017","description":"Warde Manuel's eventful decade in Ann Arbor has been marked by athletic successes and marred by controversy.","published":"2026-11-24T18:47:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49351177/2026-michigan-warde-manuel-athletic-department-tenure-line-investigation","type":"Story","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-24T18:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Trev Alberts told he won't be Michigan AD after agreement","description":"Trev Alberts was \"shocked and disheartened\" to be informed by the search firm representing Michigan that he will not be the Wolverines' next AD, he told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-24T23:50:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583155/attorney-trev-alberts-told-next-ad-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5075540/brice-pollock","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brice_Pollock"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Brice Pollock","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brice_Pollock","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:25Z","intro":"Brice Gabriel Pollock (born March 28, 2005) is an American college football cornerback for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Pollock attended Shiloh High School in Snellville, Georgia. As a senior, he had 61 tackles, two interceptions with a sack and caught 11 passes for 196 yards with four receiving touchdowns. He committed to Mississippi State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Mississippi State in 2023, Pollock started three of 11 games and recorded 24 tackles. As a junior in 2024, he started all 12 games and had 48 tackles and one interception. After the season, Pollock entered the transfer portal and transferred to Texas Tech University. He was a starter in 2025."}]}}